1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
The train leaves at nine in the morning.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
We should buy tickets today.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
My sister lives close to the old bridge.

4
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Bring a coat, it is cold at night.

5
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The market opens each Saturday.

6
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
I left the keys on the kitchen table.

7
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Call me when you get to the station.

8
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:09,000
The library closes early on Sunday.
